{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Actual authentication date/time","Date and time when this authentication was actually signed or otherwise authenticated.","Actual authentication location identifier","Identification of the location where a document was signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenicated.","AuthorizedPerson","Details related to a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorized person name","Name of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorized person identifier","Identification of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","User code list","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Crossing the border transport means name","Name to identify the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","Transport means crossing the border identifier","Identification of the means of transport used in crossing the border.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","Type of means of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying type of means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansTypeCodeList","ArrivalLocation","Details related to the first arrival location.","Port of arrival identifier","Identification of the arrival location. This would be a port for sea, airport for air and border post for land crossing.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User code list","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee name","Name of the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","Address","Details related to an address.","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Transitional element","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Process","Details relating to a Process which has, will, or is required to be performed on a commodity.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Actual temperature","Measure of temperature.","Commodity process type identification code","Code specifying the process or production associated with the commodity (e.g. method of growing, pretreatment, etc).","CommodityProcessTypeIdentificationCodeList","Commodity process type description","Description of the production method or other process applied to the commodity.","Commodity process duration","Date and time on which the process associated with the commodity was performed.","Product","Details related to the tangible article or substance produced by human or mechanical effort or by a natural process.","Product identifier","Identification of an object, for example the unique number affixed by the manufacturer to a product for identification purposes.","Commodity identifier type code","Code specifying the type of commodity identifier.","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","ProductName","Details related to the name of a product.","Commodity name","Name or term that identifies the goods assigned by a seller as distinct from those of other sellers, in legal terms known as trademark, which helps to identify one item, a family of items, or all items of that seller.","Commodity name qualifier code","Code specifying the commodity name (e.g. common name, registered name, brand name).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7081","Source","Details related to the source of goods in accordance with regulation and laws.","Source geographic region name","Name of the source geographic region (non-political).","Source country code","Code specifying the source country.","Source type code","Code specifying the type of source location.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3227","DepartureLocation","Details related to departure location.","Departure country code","Code specifying the country of departure.","Departure country name","Name of the country of departure.","DestinationLocation","Details related to the destination location.","Destination country code","Code specifying the country of destination.","Destination country name","Name of the country of destination.","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Tariff quantity amount","Amount reported in 1st, 2nd, or 3rd tariff quantity.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Shipping marks","Marks and or numbers on a transport unit or package.","UN/ECE Recommendation 15","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Consignor identifier","Identification of  the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering the transport.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","Exporter","Details related to the person/party who makes or on whose behalf an export declaration is made.","Exporter name","Name of the person who makes, or on whose behalf the export declaration is made, and who is the owner of the goods or has similar right of disposal over them at the time when the declaration is accepted.","Exporter identifier","Identification of the party who makes, or on whose behalf the export declaration is made, and who is the owner of the goods or h